# 2v2 gasless 15/15/15 roach build, v2 (user's macro plan, 2026-10-14):
# queens 1+2 and 3+4 each started together the instant 350 is there (larva held ~1 s
# for them); the 2:57 inject's 6 larva all become drones, then the next 150 -> roach
# warren and the next 50 -> both extractors (3+3 pulled off the mineral lines as they
# finish); larva held for the warren so roaches start the moment it's done; 3rd hatch
# at 3:48; after the roaches: 5th queen (the 3rd base's injector), lair at 100 gas,
# 2 more gases manned from the 3-drone far patches; the 4+4 oversaturation moves to
# the third as it finishes.
14 extractor_trick
15 hatch natural
-  default main
14 extractor_trick
15 overlord
15 pool
@natural_soon transfer 4 main natural
-  default fill
@pool_soon queens main natural            # hold ~1 s: queens before drones
26 overlord main
27 overlord main
@queen:main queens main natural           # queens 3+4 together at 350
-  cycle_overlords                       # overlords once per macro cycle, as the injects pop
@2:58 roach_warren                        # after the 2:57 inject's larva became drones
-  extractor main                         # the next 50 minerals
-  extractor natural
& @extractors:2 gas_pull 3 main
& @extractors:2 gas_pull 3 natural
& @warren_soon roaches 6 asap             # hold larva ~1.5 s so the warren is never idle
& @3:48 hatch third
& @roaches queen natural                  # 5th queen: the 3rd base's injector
& @roaches lair                           # as soon as 100 gas is banked
& @roaches extractor main                 # gases 3+4 from the oversaturation
& @roaches extractor natural
& @extractors:4 gas_pull 3 main
& @extractors:4 gas_pull 3 natural
& @third_soon transfer 4 main third
& @third_soon transfer 4 natural third
